# Where "Submit to BUSW" sends a finished project. Leave it unset (the default) and the builder
# offers the interim downloadable brief instead of claiming to deliver anything.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local (not committed) and set the endpoint once a submission service exists.
# The value is read at build time and is public in the built app, so it must not contain a secret.
VITE_SUBMISSION_URL=
